cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BetterBlockerDNS in research or in a product, cite it as below."
title: "BetterBlockerDNS: a local DNS ad and tracker blocker for Android"
abstract: >-
  BetterBlockerDNS (BBDNS) is an open-source DNS filtering app for Android. It
  runs a local VpnService tunnel that inspects DNS queries on the device and
  answers blocked names itself, so ad, tracker, malware and phishing domains
  are stopped before a connection is made. Queries are forwarded to a plain or
  DNS-over-HTTPS resolver of the user's choice; nothing is decrypted and no
  data leaves the phone. Blocklists are compiled into a compact hash index so
  that a large catalogue of lists fits in the memory of a phone.
type: software
